        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    high_prices = [120, 122, 121, 119, 123, 125, 126, 127, 126, 124, 123, 122, 121, 120, 119, 118, 120, 121, 122, 123]\n    low_prices = [115, 116, 117, 115, 118, 119, 120, 121, 122, 120, 119, 118, 116, 115, 114, 113, 114, 115, 116, 118]\n    closing_prices = [117, 118, 119, 117, 120, 123, 124, 122, 123, 121, 120, 119, 118, 117, 116, 115, 118, 120, 121, 122]\n    period = 14\n\n    highest_high = max(high_prices[-period:])\n    lowest_low = min(low_prices[-period:])\n    current_close = closing_prices[-1]\n\n    williams_r = ((highest_high - current_close) / (highest_high - lowest_low)) * -100\n    answer = round(williams_r, 2)\n\n    return answer\n```",
